sequenceDiagram

participant App

participant UDS

participant ISO-TP

participant CAN

participant ECU


App->>UDS: Send Request

UDS->>ISO-TP: Forward

ISO-TP->>CAN: Send Frame

CAN->>ECU: Request


ECU->>CAN: Negative Response (0x7F)

CAN->>ISO-TP: Receive

ISO-TP->>UDS: Forward Payload

UDS->>App: Error Code (e.g., 0x11 Service Not Supported)






